# AnswerForge – AI-Powered Voice Interview Practice

## Problem
Many candidates struggle with interview preparation because they lack opportunities to practise speaking naturally and receive immediate, personalized feedback on their answers.

## Solution
AnswerForge is an AI-powered voice interview practice platform that helps users improve their interview skills through realistic voice-based interviews, answer evaluation, and spoken feedback.

## How It Works
1. Users select an interview question and answer it using their voice.
2. **Gnani AI Speech-to-Text (STT)** converts the spoken response into text.
3. **Google Gemini** evaluates the response based on relevance, clarity, structure, and other performance factors.
4. **Gnani AI Text-to-Speech (TTS)** delivers interview questions, feedback, and suggested answers through voice.

## Key Features
- Voice-based interview practice.
- Speech-to-text transcription using Gnani AI.
- AI-powered answer evaluation and scoring.
- Spoken feedback and model answers using Gnani AI TTS.
- Interview session history and performance tracking.
- User authentication and session management.

## Technology Stack
- **Frontend:** React, Vite, Tailwind CSS
- **Backend:** Node.js, Express.js
- **Database:** MongoDB
- **AI Integration:** Gnani AI (Prisma STT and Timbre TTS), Google Gemini

## Expected Impact
AnswerForge makes interview preparation more interactive and accessible by allowing candidates to practise speaking, understand their strengths and weaknesses, and improve their confidence through immediate AI-powered feedback.

